  "scope_note": "Registered newly supplied books and separately acquired English counterparts are Human under the owner decision unless their own source explicitly declares otherwise. Copied old-bank and Iman/Quran-study translations remain Unknown regardless of language, import date, or extraction method. Arabic originals are source texts, not translations. Missing translator names, OCR, AI extraction, and AI review do not change the current translation classification. Original flags and evidence remain preserved separately.",
